{"about_the_game":"This game is a puzzle game born from dice.<br>If the faces change, the way you play will change; if the number of faces increases, the ways you can play will increase.<br>Please fully enjoy the world of Rokumen Happy.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >how to play</h2>Aim for the goal on the board while rolling Rokumen with six different faces.<br>Each face has its own characteristics, so use them to overcome obstacles on the board!<br>There is no single path to the goal, and you can play with free operations.<br>Once you have cleared the stage, try playing with the shortest number of moves.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rokumen</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709920/extras/b7c5ac2fbed1506918d4785b58c54133.avif?t=1709130336\" width=100 height=96 /></span><br>If you rotate it on a flat surface, the position of your face will change.<br>Each of the six faces has different characteristics,<br>Something with rules like dice that everyone knows.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >faces</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709920/extras/0ba1960f2b8d367ede8f390dfaa99880.webp?t=1709130336\" width=60 height=58 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709920/extras/c90164de7ac2d6def372ff4edee35ad9.webp?t=1709130336\" width=60 height=59 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709920/extras/119af6df1443486305d8dd16e44c741c.webp?t=1709130336\" width=60 height=58 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709920/extras/52e4401cf6d5c2f5f093202893ac75e4.webp?t=1709130336\" width=60 height=59 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" sr